<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico completed all three credit auctions in the secondary market.</p>
<p>    CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    2.478  bln pesos 5 days    28.00</p>
<p>    2.478  bln pesos 3 days    28.01</p>
<p>    2.478  bln pesos 1 day     27.85</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
